            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hides the KPIs (Consumption, Invested, Income, Open Fixed Costs) and the cash flow card above the booking list. The header chart has its own \"Show Chart\" switch. Budgets are independent and have their own switch too. Also available in the View menu."
